# p5 mcp discover: an HTTP server whose `server/discover` answer is an event-stream error without an id
# (mcphttp.ts `sseidless`): it answers the POST it came on (src/mcp/server.zig:1155-1158
# @481104fd), a legacy answer, so `initialize` follows at once and it is ready at 2025-11-25.
# `gwlog` copies the server log.
mcphttp sseidless
fx: homefile .fx/mcp.json p5-mcp-discover-http-profile.json
xfx: homefile .xfx/mcp.json p5-mcp-discover-http-profile.json
gateway p5-mcp-hello.json
wait 6
type /mcp show fixture
key Enter
wait 3
snap show
gwlog
